        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "Tightly arranged yet fiercely improvised,  Saxophone Nouveau  presents music by Joe Henderson, Gerry Mulligan, Dizzy Gillespie, Thelonious Monk and others arranged for the saxophone family. Voiced for five saxophones and accompanied by piano, bass and drums this is SuperSax meets Supernova!  Saxopho"
