      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "Nine-piece local band the West End Jazz Bandits takes Winnipeg by storm with their horn-y lineup and their swinging and danceable repertoire. Come for the harmon-muted trumpets, stay for the jaw-dropping stand-up bass solos, and try not to cry at the sweetness of the vocal arrangements.  Tickets cas"
