        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "CEC  familiar as an old friend; comfortable as a memory; unexpected as a dream. CEC's music is the deep sigh of release after recognizing that you've been holding your breath for no reason at all. The Treaty One-based artist and producer uniquely blends contemporary RnB and neo-soul while writing in"
