        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "The Women's Day Concert  features the W2JO (WJO's all-female identifying version) featuring old standards and new works. The Winnipeg Jazz Orchestra has a mission toward equity, diversity, and inclusion. Women have a decisive influence on jazz, and we choose to celebrate that. The future of jazz is"
