      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "On Saturday, February 15th, the WJO celebrates the joy of love through song at this post-Valentine's Day concert. They are also proud to introduce Winnipeg audiences to the international multi-award winning Filipina jazz vocalist,  Charito.  Her highly personal and expressive vocal style, incorporat"
