        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "Jovelle Balani  (she/her) is a Filipino-Canadian artist noted for her sultry, contralto voice. Her music incorporates influences from pop and old jazz to soul—a sound that is uniquely hers.  Door open at 6:30pm   More info &amp; tickets here"
