        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "Location: Berney Theatre    Izzy Asper Jazz Performances close the 2024/25 season on May 17 and 18 with  Jane Bunnett and Maqueque . An abiding passion for Afro-Cuban rhythms and melodies drives internationally-acclaimed musician and five-time Juno Award winner Jane Bunnett. Just over ten years ago,"
