      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "For one very special Halloween evening, The Basement presents The River City Syncopators! Winnipeg's only 1920s hot jazz band in Winnipeg's only true authentic 1920s speakeasy - this is going to be one fun, unforgettable Halloween.&nbsp;  So dress yourself up, find the secret entrance, and dance"
