      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "Iconic Cree playwright Tomson Highway brings his wit, charm and boundless enthusiasm back home to Winnipeg as the WJO, with acclaimed Peruvian-Canadian vocalist Patricia Cano, reimagines music from his award-winning plays  The Post Mistress ,  Cree Country ,  The Rez Sisters , and others."
