    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "Two-time GRAMMY® award winners, Cathy Fink and Marcy Marxer, are master musicians with a career spanning over 35 years. Their superb harmonies are backed by instrumental virtuosity on the guitar, five-string banjo, ukulele, mandolin, cello-banjo, and more. Their repertoire ranges from classic countr"
