        "@value": "Join singer Rosemarie Todaschuk with Rick Boughton on piano and Karl Kohut on upright bass Wednesday, July 31, 2024 at 6:30-8:30 pm at Resto Gare Bistro for Jazz at the Station. Restaurant reservations are recommended.   *Please note that this is not a Jazz Winnipeg event and as such we cannot answe"
