    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "It has been a long time since we last featured the music of George Gershwin. Years ago the WJO’s then board president, Ed Shinewald, first made the suggestion that we present a Gershwin concert and it has been a successful theme ever since (this is at least our third since 1997).  Gershwin was one o"
