      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "Kevin Waters  is a performer and educator, currently based in Winnipeg. After moving to Winnipeg to study jazz drum set under Quincy Davis at the University of Manitoba, Kevin quickly rose to be one of the city’s most in-demand drummers, playing with a myriad of acts and styles, including folk-count"
