      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "The distinctive 70's sound of Steely Dan is revived with the WJO and special guests Larry Roy and Leonard Shaw. This show will be a retrospective performing songs from albums: Can’t Buy a Thrill (1972), Countdown to Ecstasy (1973), Pretzel Logic (1974), Katy Lied (1975), their best selling album Aja"
      }
