        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "The  Huu Bac Quintet , led by Montreal-born composer and multi-instrumentalist extraordinaire Huu Bac Quach, embodies the perfect fusion of exciting musical cultures. He brilliantly blends his Vietnamese and Chinese heritage with the magic of jazz to create a unique and intoxicating sonic experience"
