      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "Portage and Mainers are reknowned for treating their seasonal affective disorder by staying inside to rock and roll when it's 40 below but here's a new remedy: a house call from  Dr. Henry , ready to treat your SAD with an exciting hit of groovy, hip-shaking, Afro-fusion jazz!  Dr. Henry Band's thre"
      }
