      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "The Women's Day Concert features the W2JO (WJO's all-women version) performing a concert celebrating women in jazz. We are grateful to the Jewish Foundation of Manitoba for supporting four new works, written or arranged by women in Manitoba, that will be premiered at the concert! We will also featur"
