        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "A trio characterized by their dynamic fluidity, “freaky alien” textures, rule-breaking grooves and disregard for genre boundaries. Their sound makes audiences “take another look at music as a whole” and is described as “a pivotal addition to modern jazz.” Leader  Tetyana Haraschuk ’s compositions ar"
