        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "The temperature rises under the spotlight when Rosemarie Todaschuk’s velvety voice and dynamic stage presence kick things up with favourite  jazz standards mixed with Latin, funk, blues and popular tunes. The Winnipeg Sun noted that \"Todaschuk applies her velvet vocal touch to  timeless classic"
