    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "Clayton Joseph Chenier is Creole music royalty. His father, the legendary Clifton Chenier, invented the style of music we know today as Zydeco and was the first Creole musician to be recognized with a Grammy Award.  Raised in this indigenous American culture with its own distinctive language, cuisin"
