        "@value": "Bassist  Marika Galea  and trumpeter  Rachel Therrien  are no strangers to playing together. Since meeting in New York in 2016, they have extensively performed material from many of Rachel’s past releases (V for Vena, Why Don’t You Try, Home Inspiration) as part of her Canadian band.  Working betwee"
