      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "Celebrate the Jazz Age with us this summer! Jazz Winnipeg proudly presents its series of Jazz Age Garden Parties at the  Dalnavert Museum . This series of six jazz and jazz-adjacent concerts updates the spirit of the Roaring Twenties for a new century this summer in Winnipeg.  Enjoy music, cocktails"
