        "@value": "The Wet Secrets are a six-piece rock 'n’ roll gang fueled by a primal, fuzzy, punk-rock spirit and steered by a love of slinky disco, art rock, ‘70s horns, and AM-gold songwriting. Known for their signature red and white marching band uniforms, and harmonious layers of horns, synthesizers, booming b"
      }
