        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "THE FIRST ANNUAL JAZZ WINNIPEG AIR SAX COMPETITION!   Bring your honk, your dance moves, your who-can-it-be-nows and born-to-runs, your stretchy jeans, your most slaying-est struts. We're hosting the first ever Air Sax Competition, and the winner will go down in local lore.&nbsp;  $5 to enter. F"
