      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "While Robi Botos is known for being a strong player in the traditional jazz and funk fields, he always incorporates an element of the music he grew up listening to into his playing. Born in Hungary, Robi, a trained pianist, moved to Canada at age 20. He released his sophomore album,  Movin’ Forward"
