      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "Alsarah &amp; the Nubatones were born out of a common love for the richness of pentatonic sounds, shared migration experiences, and Nubian music culture. The Brooklyn-based group, fronted by Sudanese singer-songwriter Alsarah, has developed a unique East-African retro-pop sound, which mixes ‘70s"
