        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "Allison Au is an award-winning saxophonist, composer and arranger. Growing up in Toronto, she was captivated by the unhinged freedom of jazz, which, in combination with elements of classical, hip-hop, and Latin music, influences Au’s soulful sound today. Leader of the Allison Au Quartet, Au’s debut"
