      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "In 2017 Oshawa-born R&amp;B singer-songwriter Daniel Caesar had one hell of a year. Caesar's intimate, dark, and ambient-tinged soul made an immediate impression on critics and fans alike. His debut studio album, Freudian, earned two GRAMMY nominations; made numerous appearances on the late-nigh"
