        "@value": "We are pleased to announce the return of Dinner and a Show to fill your ears with beautiful music by Laila Biali and your bellies with a glorious meal by Chef Ben Kramer. Join us for either the early or the late seating on  January 24 &nbsp;at Kitchen Sync  for an unforgettable evening.  Award-w"
